WEBVTT

00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:08.342
Open Reports, Artificial Intelligence Reports, and AI Chat Extracted Data.

00:00:08.342 --> 00:00:12.645
It lists what the assistant collected, one row for each chat.

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:16.692
Choose the AI profile, which is required, and click Show.

00:00:17.145 --> 00:00:21.639
Each row has the session date, the session ID, and one column for

00:00:21.639 --> 00:00:25.437
each detail that you named, such as the email address.

00:00:25.437 --> 00:00:28.855
Export as CSV is how leads reach another system.

